    "description": {
      "value": "This staff of magically hardened wood is topped with a silver sculpture depicting magical runic symbols. When used as a weapon, a staff of power is a +2 greater striking staff. Voluntarily destroying a staff of power unleashes an incredible blast of energy. When wielding the staff, you can Interact to break it. This releases a 30-foot-burst magical explosion centered on the staff. This deals 2d8 force damage per charge remaining in the staff (DC 40 basic Reflex save) You automatically critically fail your save. A creature reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage dies instantly; this is a death effect. You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. 1st ray of enfeeblement 2nd continual flame 3rd levitate 4th globe of invulnerability, paralyze 5th magic missile 6th wall of force 7th cone of cold, fireball, lightning bolt"
    },
